<title>USA: Kmart offers new credit card.</title>
<headline>Kmart offers new credit card.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kmart Corp. said Tuesday that it was offering a new private-label credit card throughout the United States.</p>
<p>The nation's second largest retailer said the card, introduced Monday, features rebates of up to a 6 percent on eligible purchases.</p>
<p>The credit card has the company's name, with a big red and white &quot;K&quot; on the front, and a black background.</p>
<p>The Kmart credit card, offered through Beneficial National Bank USA, a unit of Beneficial Corp., and various incentive programmes were tested in 11 markets throughout the United States earlier this year.</p>
</text>
